{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":4},"Les Déguns 2","Après leurs déboires et leurs aventures du premier opus, Nordine Salhi et Karim Jeb alias Karim et Nono reviennent plus en forme et plus déterminés que jamais et continuent leur quête de succès par tous les moyens. Après un premier échec cuisant dans l’univers de la télé-réalité, les deux acolytes décident de se lancer dans le rap. Dans sa recherche du succès musical, Karim, alias Nécrophile, aidé de son manager Nono, ne cesse d’accumuler des tentatives ratées. Une opportunité vers la célébrité est saisie, mais tout ne se passe pas comme prévu, et les mésaventures vont s'enchaîner pour les deux protagonistes.",[],{"type":5,"id":6,"slug":7,"title":8,"release":10,"filmType":14,"directors":15,"genre":27,"media":29,"synopsis":32,"production":33,"characters":36,"roles":37,"awards":52,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_145","fr2023-145-les-deguns-2",{"native":1,"english":9},"",{"type":11,"date":12,"year":13},"Theatrical release","2023-07-26",2023,"Fiction film",[16,23],{"id":17,"slug":18,"name":17,"birthYear":19,"deathYear":19,"gender":20,"nationality":21,"awards":22},"Cyrille Droux","cyrille-droux",0,"Male identifying","France",[],{"id":24,"slug":25,"name":24,"birthYear":19,"deathYear":19,"gender":20,"nationality":21,"awards":26},"Claude Zidi Jr.","claude-zidi-jr",[],[28],"Comedy",{"posterUrl":30,"trailerUrl":31},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/134/17/266630/format_page/les-deguns-2.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Cvo9t98S4G4",{"native":2,"english":9},[34],{"country":21,"share":35},"Majority coproducer",[],[38,42,45],{"person":39,"role":41},{"id":24,"slug":25,"name":24,"birthYear":19,"deathYear":19,"gender":20,"nationality":21,"awards":40},[],"Director of the film",{"person":43,"role":41},{"id":17,"slug":18,"name":17,"birthYear":19,"deathYear":19,"gender":20,"nationality":21,"awards":44},[],{"person":46,"role":51},{"id":47,"slug":48,"name":47,"birthYear":49,"dea